# EAS Build archive exclusions.
#
# Nested .gitignore files (e.g. apps/mobile/android/.gitignore) are not
# reliably honored by the EAS project archive step, so local build caches
# can leak into the uploaded archive. This caused a real failure: a stale
# apps/mobile/android/build/generated/autolinking/autolinking.json baked an
# absolute Windows path (from a local `expo run:android`) that broke the
# Gradle build on EAS's Linux workers.
#
# Keep these root-anchored so they're excluded no matter which machine
# generated them locally.
apps/mobile/android/build/
apps/mobile/android/.gradle/
apps/mobile/android/app/build/
apps/mobile/android/.cxx/
apps/mobile/android/app/.cxx/
apps/mobile/ios/build/
apps/mobile/ios/Pods/
apps/mobile/.expo/
